zstddeclib.c was generated from the tarball with
  cd build/single_file_libs && ./create_single_file_decoder.sh
(which runs combine.py -r ../../lib -x legacy/zstd_legacy.h -o zstddeclib.c
zstddeclib-in.c); zstd.h, zstd_errors.h and LICENSE are lib/zstd.h,
lib/zstd_errors.h and LICENSE as shipped.
Unmodified. dch compiles zstddeclib.c into the binary (Makefile.in), so
X-ray decodes Codex's .jsonl.zst rollouts (#656) with no system libzstd.
